%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S14_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: When all the sound goes quiet and I feel like I've stopped falling, I open
      my eyes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c25807cf07d3642429ff3af939d3ec19, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh? Everything is dark. In fact, it's pitch black. I can't see a thing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I begin to question wether I really have my eyes open or not, but it stays
      the same, even after blinking a few times.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try to reach for anything tangible in the darkness. It feels like I'm
      floating through empty space.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Stay still. You wont be able to see anything, only our eyes are able to
      see in this space.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The Spirit from earlier!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Where am I? What are you going to do to me now?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We are in the realm of the abyss where we, the Interdimensional Spirits,
      reside. It is also the place where we came up with our plan to unify all the
      dimensions.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The realm of the abyss? Is this where they originate from?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Don't fret. Nothing will happen to you, as long as you agree to stay here
      and don't get in our way. We will make your stay here as comfortable as possible.
      You will not feel a thing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That sounds like you are going to put me into a coma.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The Spirit ignores my remark.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "We will proceed to peacefully bring every universe into yours, it will
      serve as the main vessel. And, of course, your lover will remain untouched\u2026
      By us."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Something's fishy.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Why did you say it like that? I don't see how you can make this sound so
      peaceful and harmless. Where's the catch?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I hear the voice cackle ominously.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: WE won't be doing anything violent. We only wish to rule over the empire
      that our plan creates. To get there, we bring all the dimensions together,
      along with all the inhabitants.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Why? Was the world not perfectly fine before?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You don't know anything. If all the universes unite, that means that all
      the powers and energies that exist out there unite as well. From there, it
      will be survival of the fittest and everything will sort itself into it's natural
      order.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Natural? The state of only one universe existing is an artificial order,
      created by you and your other abyssal Spirits! You can't call that natural.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And what you just said sounds like all the different inhabitants are going
      to get into one big massacre. I can't let you do that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But don't you agree? One Dimension is far easier to oversee than multiple.
      It makes your work a little simpler, no?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That bastard is still trying to gaslight me into thinking their plans are
      for the greater good.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My work would have been just fine if you hadn't created this chaos by making
      entryways into my dimension and killing my mentor in the process.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, so you noticed our efforts? Our kind has always yearned for total control.
      Maybe it was out of spite.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I mean, all we knew was this empty darkness, so once we got a taste of
      the light from other dimensions we just couldn't be satiated anymore.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And that led to you going against the former Sustainer?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You could say that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I knew it. All that weird stuff that happened was because of them.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think back to my first day at work.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They were trying to execute their plan even then, but it seems like the
      former Sustainer was still interfering.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It's true, the former Sustainer was giving us quite some trouble. Even
      after the wench died, the traps she set for us hindered us for a while. But
      now that the pest has been dealt with, we are back on track with the plan.
      Our success is near, I can feel it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db6143dffc3415a4cb9df1bede0e2ac3, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 23bfb76f68c3481f83c093694e64c3fc, type: 2}
